###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Water-model errors are stated only as bounds ('MAD errors in energy below 1 kcal/mol and errors in force of less than 2 kcal/mol/A'); the endo-in-water validation reports 'the energy error of 2 meV/atom' without naming the metric. Neither is encoded.
# - Free-energy barriers (e.g. 18.8 and 20.3 kcal/mol in water), hydrogen-bond analyses and RDFs are property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/zhang2024modelling.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
